    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Traditional serrated adenoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Some traditional serrated adenomas contain areas with increased number of goblet cells admixed with non-goblet columnar epithelial cells.",
    "source": "Christophe N. Rosty",
    "copyright": "",
